OL,3,GNEWSAMore council tax rises possible as
OL,4,A#50m cuts planned
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarrington Council could see future
OL,7,Fcouncil tax increases above 5% as it
OL,8,Fplans #50m of cuts to balance its
OL,9,Fbooks.
OL,11,FThe council's scrutiny committee
OL,12,Fquestioned the executive team and
OL,13,Fcabinet on the proposed cuts - which
OL,14,Fcould see the loss of more than 200
OL,15,Fjobs - and discussed areas including
OL,16,Fcost savings in adult social care and a
OL,17,Freview of leisure and library services.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
