OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMore council tax rises possible as
OL,4,A#50m cuts planned
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen asked about future possible
OL,7,Fabove-5% council tax increases - which
OL,8,Fthe authority received permission to do
OL,9,Fthis year - leader Hans Mundry said it
OL,10,Fwas "on the table" and the council as
OL,11,F"not making any commitments".
OL,13,FThe savings plans will go to cabinet on
OL,14,FWednesday (9 September) and then before
OL,15,Ffull council on 21 September.
